{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 6.960000038146973, "text": "Please get as much help as possible to get to me.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 6.960000038146973, "end_seconds": 12.720000267028809, "text": "Earlier this year, Lucinda Ritchie was moved from hospital to a nursing home against her will.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 12.720000267028809, "end_seconds": 16.15999984741211, "text": "What is the point of my life?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 16.15999984741211, "end_seconds": 19.360000610351562, "text": "I heard from Lucinda on the day and investigated.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 19.360000610351562, "end_seconds": 25.760000228881836, "text": "I asked the NHS if Lucinda's an adult with mental capacity wasn't moving her against her will", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 25.760000228881836, "end_seconds": 29.1200008392334, "text": "unlawful. They've never given me a direct answer.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 29.1200008392334, "end_seconds": 33.52000045776367, "text": "The NHS Care Board, who organised the nursing home and said it was for her safety,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 33.52000045776367, "end_seconds": 37.7599983215332, "text": "now say it was the hospital who was responsible for moving Lucinda.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 37.7599983215332, "end_seconds": 43.52000045776367, "text": "She says her powered wheelchair was switched off and she was manually pushed into an ambulance.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 44.15999984741211, "end_seconds": 49.7599983215332, "text": "It made me see a different side of the NHS.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 49.7599983215332, "end_seconds": 52.959999084472656, "text": "Two days later, she ended up back in hospital.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 52.959999084472656, "end_seconds": 57.599998474121094, "text": "Three months later, she is still there, even though she doesn't need to be.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 57.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 61.68000030517578, "text": "This is getting too short, though.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 61.68000030517578, "end_seconds": 66.08000183105469, "text": "The issue is, Lucinda needs 24-hour support to live her life back at home,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 66.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 69.27999877929688, "text": "and that's organised and paid for by the NHS.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 69.27999877929688, "end_seconds": 72.63999938964844, "text": "That is what she had before she was studying for a master's.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 72.63999938964844, "end_seconds": 75.83999633789062, "text": "She's a gamer, she's a petrolhead, she had a life.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 75.83999633789062, "end_seconds": 77.5199966430664, "text": "And that's what she wants to get back to.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 77.5199966430664, "end_seconds": 80.31999969482422, "text": "She says she just needs the right support to live it.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 80.87999725341797, "end_seconds": 84.08000183105469, "text": "Gives me my freedom, independence,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 84.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 88.87999725341797, "text": "things to live and work and spend time.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 88.87999725341797, "end_seconds": 93.12000274658203, "text": "NHS policy says care should be focused on what matters to people.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 93.12000274658203, "end_seconds": 98.16000366210938, "text": "NHS Sussex and Surrey Integrated Care Board says it's deeply sorry to hear of Lucinda's", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 98.16000366210938, "end_seconds": 104.16000366210938, "text": "ongoing concerns. It says its priority is to ensure plans are in place for Lucinda to leave hospital.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "Ok5257sn5M0", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 110.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 113.27999877929688, "text": "For more UN videos visit www.un.org", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
